{"id": "official:sentence:de2e7f31-ef9d-415a-9e1a-ee2c7d535f75", "text": "我找到了一个解决方法，但我发现得太快，以至于这不可能是正确的解决方法。", "shortMeaning": "我找到了办法，但发现得太快，多半不是正确的解法。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9755a5a6-e919-4cb4-895b-b37b86ec9ff9", "text": "我找到了我要的书。", "shortMeaning": "我找到要的那本书了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:642d73bc-e36a-4bc1-afa9-fa5d526778d5", "text": "我找到了歌词，但是没法转贴过来。", "shortMeaning": "我找到歌词了，但没法转贴过来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2b569aef-c0b7-4b57-888e-0821ec70084f", "text": "我找到你了，没有么？", "shortMeaning": "我找到你了，不是吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3eca49dd-0a9b-48ee-bdf7-cc6d6d3acde3", "text": "我找到那把我一直在找的钥匙了。", "shortMeaning": "我找到了那把一直找的钥匙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:61bf09f7-220d-4839-8cb0-cb7160580c91", "text": "我承认他说的是事实。", "shortMeaning": "我承认他讲的是事实。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:51c0bbf2-a2ce-46fc-a5b2-b8ea6f74a71f", "text": "我承认我没有做我答应做的。", "shortMeaning": "我承认没做答应过的事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b1925fa8-f94f-4735-8529-6459c9a250af", "text": "我承认这可能不是最好的方法。", "shortMeaning": "我承认这也许不是最好的办法。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0be48055-fccf-47d6-9735-467c8db08c13", "text": "我承认，我不是世界上最整洁的人。", "shortMeaning": "我承认自己不是世上最整洁的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:39e06e17-350b-497f-aeaa-d41831bfc5cf", "text": "我承认，我的用词有点直接。", "shortMeaning": "我承认我的用词有点直接。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:12392b65-5010-48a2-8822-9b53a1fd7fec", "text": "我承认，没有他，我未来十年的生活将会是空虚的、没有目标的。", "shortMeaning": "我承认没有他，未来十年的生活会空虚无目标。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0f6a8158-2e25-4781-b193-947cd749495c", "text": "我把一打鸡蛋买好了。", "shortMeaning": "我买了一打鸡蛋。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3822404e-b6fe-40af-beb2-a6eba61b1391", "text": "我把书放下来然后开灯。", "shortMeaning": "我放下书，然后开灯。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5efe835a-2402-4a09-8f9f-895109c99c5d", "text": "我把事故怪在他身上。", "shortMeaning": "我把事故归咎于他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:48705dad-5006-42e8-8312-00917b8a77f5", "text": "我把他带到校区里最贵的餐馆去了。", "shortMeaning": "我带他去了校区最贵的餐馆。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:19d63e3b-8ec5-4cf2-bc11-7ce633cb0bfd", "text": "我把他当成一个老实人。", "shortMeaning": "我把他当成老实人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9c96b091-f1ef-4208-ab71-2dba98c99266", "text": "我把他当成自己的好友之一。", "shortMeaning": "我把他当作自己的好友。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:056edb6c-4c71-4e35-ad35-bc9b4d856b43", "text": "我把他的书还给了他。", "shortMeaning": "我把书还给了他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0fadfb6c-7d14-48b1-8552-79c1abeab87c", "text": "我把你看做一个老实人。", "shortMeaning": "我把你当成老实人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6b219a24-5c12-4ebb-b181-75133dd72a3b", "text": "我把信用卡交你保管。", "shortMeaning": "我把信用卡交给你保管。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:159ebb71-83e3-40c3-b49e-30decca83eff", "text": "我把充电器的型号记下了。", "shortMeaning": "我记下了充电器型号。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:71d7fcb2-02ed-49f1-9cc7-07afcb9b1a6b", "text": "我把六扇窗都关上了。", "shortMeaning": "我把六扇窗全关上了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ffadc834-d573-46fc-a790-4b51aa2766c9", "text": "我把剩下的东西给我的狗吃。", "shortMeaning": "我把剩下的东西给狗吃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:edce962a-b205-454b-a5ec-8fe4d5c231b6", "text": "我把大门涂成蓝色。", "shortMeaning": "我把大门刷成蓝色。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a76c8ff5-79c2-49d2-901d-2f9857d11c0b", "text": "我把她忘在车库里了。", "shortMeaning": "我把她落在车库里了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0c45bb3e-efb0-4423-a520-98549fda8718", "text": "我把她的字典还给了她。", "shortMeaning": "我把字典还给了她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3f764a25-2224-413f-94a7-194e05576f34", "text": "我把它带到了旧货店。", "shortMeaning": "我把它带到旧货店去了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:994e273d-d1ca-49ee-bbca-4cd39cd913e2", "text": "我把它忘在车库里了。", "shortMeaning": "我把它落在车库里了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3715a681-1284-416b-b70e-d80937d9b661", "text": "我把它留在桌上了。", "shortMeaning": "我把它落在桌上了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e38e40c3-fab6-4ad9-84b1-291eabda5bc1", "text": "我把建筑称作为凝固的音乐。", "shortMeaning": "我把建筑称作凝固的音乐。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:417b04d4-9f19-407e-af1e-867e6bbf12d5", "text": "我把心里话说出来了。", "shortMeaning": "我说出了心里话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:66080c52-36e6-4945-a071-f5a2f6c33ab1", "text": "我把我仅有的钱给了那个男孩。", "shortMeaning": "我把仅有的钱给了那个男孩。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3431424f-39f8-4302-bfa9-eae6976d0363", "text": "我把我借来的刀还了。", "shortMeaning": "我把借来的刀还了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c8f9f97a-e59f-4ff9-9d35-12de372f8e79", "text": "我把我所有的房子都卖了。", "shortMeaning": "我把自己所有的房子都卖了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:70fea7c5-47dd-43a8-ac52-ec2fcda817b2", "text": "我把我的手提公文包丢了。", "shortMeaning": "我把手提公文包丢了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a60a4dbe-89e8-4b3e-8879-78d5a7b7c9b5", "text": "我把我的旧车挂到网购平台上卖掉了。", "shortMeaning": "我把旧车挂到网购平台卖掉了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:654d49e9-62f7-4be9-bb34-6bdd71437e54", "text": "我把我的行为看成是犯罪。", "shortMeaning": "我把自己的行为看成犯罪。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4176a7dd-3955-48ee-ad50-ad9a8acdeb1d", "text": "我把我的财产托付给他。", "shortMeaning": "我把财产托付给他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2f867993-a518-42e0-bd24-9530bebf1813", "text": "我把我的钥匙留在桌子上面了。你可以把钥匙带给我吗？", "shortMeaning": "我把钥匙落在桌上了，你能带给我吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7c7c829b-9d18-43c4-96f1-2046d03d2eb9", "text": "我把我的鞋放在床下。", "shortMeaning": "我把鞋放在床下。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:92eea0a1-07eb-4800-b83c-36a07870ae26", "text": "我把我的饭卡弄丢了。", "shortMeaning": "我把饭卡弄丢了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2a30c55b-a0cb-4432-bc18-08a05597b834", "text": "我把房子卖了个好价钱。", "shortMeaning": "房子我卖了个好价。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2f864dab-2bf3-4739-a9f5-75d48c770740", "text": "我把整个止汗剂抹遍全身。如果汗从我脑顶喷出来，你就知道原因了。", "shortMeaning": "我把止汗剂抹遍全身，若汗从头顶喷出你就知道原因了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f7ba0788-0c19-410b-84bd-3c18dc1dfd78", "text": "我把果酱撒到电源插座上短路了。", "shortMeaning": "我把果酱撒到插座上，短路了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3114fc37-3a34-4fad-9757-26cac712926f", "text": "我把案子跟你说说。", "shortMeaning": "我把情况跟你说说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e921c118-f07d-40dc-be16-cd1ce312f562", "text": "我把橡皮切成很多小块使用。", "shortMeaning": "我把橡皮切成许多小块用。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d74eae71-6f01-448a-bd9d-6b0a95fa9603", "text": "我把正门漆成蓝色了。", "shortMeaning": "我把正门刷成蓝色了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fd630caf-0d4e-45b2-8331-eb84a7fa0b84", "text": "我把牛肉切碎，拌上酱汁，擀成饼，准备煎汉堡肉。", "shortMeaning": "我把牛肉切碎拌酱擀成饼，准备煎汉堡肉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:663856ff-de51-4f2b-b91a-2ac499273801", "text": "我把盒子扛在肩上。", "shortMeaning": "我把盒子扛在肩头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3b70b5f4-08f1-4b33-9334-63ad660165a3", "text": "我把窗户打开一点。", "shortMeaning": "我把窗户开了一点。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:02832171-83fa-4d17-b9f6-4dad13ddb7ac", "text": "我把笔记放在宿舍了，现在回去拿。", "shortMeaning": "我把笔记落宿舍了，现在回去拿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:15405033-882c-4f13-841a-cbca99ec8acb", "text": "我把篱笆漆成了绿色。", "shortMeaning": "我把篱笆刷成了绿色。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:484ff9b6-5a42-4e49-ab3f-cd9552249fe6", "text": "我把自己当成你的监护人。", "shortMeaning": "我把自己当作你的监护人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e097150e-dd27-46b9-9829-70bd3de01c97", "text": "我把自己的字典放在了能立即够到的地方。", "shortMeaning": "我把字典放在伸手就够得到的地方。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:35a1ba8d-587d-466f-b209-7c3799c7b1a8", "text": "我把自己的鞋子扔掉了。", "shortMeaning": "我扔掉了自己的鞋。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5305d06b-e4a0-407b-b00e-60f0305774c0", "text": "我把蛋黄酱和番茄酱拌到一起。", "shortMeaning": "我把蛋黄酱和番茄酱拌在一起。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:637a768b-c383-4449-ae73-514b573ff71f", "text": "我把课本翻到最后一页。", "shortMeaning": "我把课本翻到末页。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:af67af68-ee30-4a3c-98a4-fc699ad5aa75", "text": "我把这本书从头到尾读了一遍。", "shortMeaning": "我把这本书从头读到尾。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cf2d62b9-ca89-4d46-bdab-a97013f3d4f2", "text": "我把这本书借给你。", "shortMeaning": "这本书我借给你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e651e137-0af4-49ad-8c78-6ae6834e8a52", "text": "我把钱都花在衣服、食物和书籍上了。", "shortMeaning": "我把钱都花在衣服、食物和书上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:377ab0d3-ff81-4937-8490-988e5c6a2627", "text": "我把门关了，这样他们就听不到我们了。", "shortMeaning": "我关上门，这样他们就听不到我们了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c4779648-dea8-4f66-a3b2-eed443240976", "text": "我把雨伞留在电车上了。", "shortMeaning": "我把雨伞落在电车上了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:55639dcd-5fbc-469e-a514-ee87cc8eb401", "text": "我抓不到句子的确切含义。", "shortMeaning": "我抓不住句子的确切含义。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5d335f5a-ca1c-434a-bf31-3c9744f4ae67", "text": "我抱着去美国的想法学英语。", "shortMeaning": "我为去美国而学英语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:26f89cf5-44d9-4c90-b740-4acd9b173482", "text": "我抵抗不了甜食的诱惑。", "shortMeaning": "我抵挡不了甜食的诱惑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9aebbb36-947e-43a0-a6cb-76ffb9706984", "text": "我抵挡不住汉堡的诱惑。", "shortMeaning": "我挡不住汉堡的诱惑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:472abbeb-9d04-452c-8ec7-e7a129e27101", "text": "我担心可能帮不了你，你需要找其他人帮忙。", "shortMeaning": "我担心帮不了你，你得找别人帮忙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0a94adfe-9e40-4db1-b79c-548b00f2855f", "text": "我拒绝回答你的问题。", "shortMeaning": "我不回答你的问题。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:345b6283-e054-4756-99ba-30d3fe145ac1", "text": "我拒绝被你像奴隶一样对待。", "shortMeaning": "我拒绝像奴隶一样被你对待。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:669a3803-cfbf-44be-ace4-224dc1c9670f", "text": "我拥有的书比我能读的书多。", "shortMeaning": "我拥有的书比能读的多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5469f4c1-7562-4fcd-9722-4cda113dfb1f", "text": "我拿着一份工资打两份工。", "shortMeaning": "我拿一份工资干两份活。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:62c46422-fa73-4f1d-a7ce-c06557205717", "text": "我挑不出他的毛病。", "shortMeaning": "他的毛病我挑不出来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2e0f1126-c7f6-4262-84c1-406ad115f3e1", "text": "我接到了她的电话。", "shortMeaning": "我接到她的电话了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6d7385e5-a852-43bd-bf10-dc78d4fc3698", "text": "我接受，但有一个条件。", "shortMeaning": "我接受，不过有条件。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:56b1ebf8-317a-413d-9c98-9f2200a67c55", "text": "我接种了流感疫苗。", "shortMeaning": "我打了流感疫苗。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:091708bb-0371-4fc2-83db-25b1fd0c2e3c", "text": "我搞不清楚你想说什么。", "shortMeaning": "我搞不清你想说什么。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3d97d986-4d93-494f-b899-a62c08d60e75", "text": "我搞明白了会告诉你。", "shortMeaning": "我弄明白了会告诉你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e9366e3c-5f97-4a9a-805a-435e1cf2f818", "text": "我搬在十八层楼，正房跟大厅都面南。", "shortMeaning": "我搬到十八层，正房和大厅都朝南。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3084e3ac-6fdd-422a-b29a-a829290cdf26", "text": "我搭电梯去了四楼。", "shortMeaning": "我坐电梯去了四楼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bd37af86-876b-495a-90c8-0fb92e8fdebb", "text": "我摘下帽子进了教堂。", "shortMeaning": "我摘帽进了教堂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a9616dcf-a3d1-4131-a45d-9ab089804d88", "text": "我摧毁了所有的证据。", "shortMeaning": "我毁掉了所有证据。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:19eee3e8-a770-45f4-979a-96dcb0d3eb02", "text": "我收到一份电报，说我叔叔到了。", "shortMeaning": "我收到电报，说我叔叔到了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3461190c-76e0-4054-9019-1be7a6f76e9e", "text": "我收到一封一周前写的信。", "shortMeaning": "我收到封一周前写的信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0bb97ba3-2d7f-4cf3-86c2-474ee56d577c", "text": "我收到了一张请帖。", "shortMeaning": "我收到张请帖。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:00a61ed4-fd7c-47be-9ad6-a6fd49c4c718", "text": "我收集各国的娃娃。", "shortMeaning": "我收集各国娃娃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ad0b8c92-7434-40cf-a3f7-b7e5dd675a2f", "text": "我改了一下我的网站的布局。", "shortMeaning": "我改了一下网站的布局。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:25a7320d-9052-4f5b-bd4a-53ad213870e6", "text": "我改了一下我网站的版面设计。", "shortMeaning": "我改了一下网站的版面设计。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b9975dc-0aa9-40b1-a120-275e9d25ef49", "text": "我放弃了。爱尔兰牧师和非洲巫婆有什么共同点？", "shortMeaning": "我放弃了。爱尔兰牧师和非洲巫婆有何共同点？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e8a76a7b-eb1a-4ee5-ba4e-3b8364da8420", "text": "我放松时会听古典乐。", "shortMeaning": "我放松时听古典音乐。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1e304f4e-8ebd-481d-a3b3-e23fc4a26502", "text": "我敢花的就只那么多。", "shortMeaning": "我敢花的就那么多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:62fb5640-6941-4b93-b182-cf3154146c10", "text": "我敢说他不是个坏男生。", "shortMeaning": "我敢说他不是坏男生。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ee680e5f-d444-4798-a315-7c8a28ea4327", "text": "我敢说他是无辜的。", "shortMeaning": "我敢肯定他是无辜的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4cddcd9b-6883-45c7-85aa-89254b36deb6", "text": "我敢说明天会下雨。", "shortMeaning": "我敢肯定明天下雨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c06d30c1-173e-491f-9f57-c24a105a101f", "text": "我散了一下步，只是为了透透气。", "shortMeaning": "我散了会儿步，只为透透气。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c9c52ebb-d9e0-433b-ac00-9776acef5eb3", "text": "我敲门，但是没有人回应。", "shortMeaning": "我敲门，但没人回应。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bdee7956-fd0a-448e-b92c-9cdcf23db905", "text": "我整个下午都在花园里。", "shortMeaning": "我一下午都在花园。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a5876d24-24aa-4fe4-9059-40994fa943c6", "text": "我整夜都能听到狗叫。", "shortMeaning": "我整晚都听到狗叫。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ee1e9b87-189f-4315-a56a-ca54f551188e", "text": "我整天待在图书馆。", "shortMeaning": "我整天都在图书馆。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:54a97162-150d-413d-ac83-6f56f54d6e10", "text": "我整晚都开着窗户。", "shortMeaning": "我整晚开着窗。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1241bcc6-1272-49ac-ba8f-d4eff4983338", "text": "我斩钉截铁地拒绝了。", "shortMeaning": "我坚决地拒绝了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:55eaeada-03f5-4417-93e6-e9a3c0454b99", "text": "我新家的客厅很宽敞。", "shortMeaning": "我新家客厅很宽敞。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:adb4f29e-cc34-437d-a184-d3a5c59f68d9", "text": "我方想提出两个问题。", "shortMeaning": "我们这边想提两个问题。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:05497fcb-1294-45bf-ac3f-4eb71985d575", "text": "我无奈只得跟随着她。", "shortMeaning": "我无奈只得跟着她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c1f74072-61b3-49ec-9dc0-88c1e66eff21", "text": "我无意争辩你的理论。", "shortMeaning": "我不想争辩你的理论。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:66074c76-cc30-4f36-b25e-877c9ef60275", "text": "我无权提出要求，而且你有权无视我写的这些垃圾，怎么样都随你的便。", "shortMeaning": "我无权提要求，你有权无视我写的这些垃圾，随你便。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:33ec950e-2175-4593-8891-5c2186d32395", "text": "我无法不去想被偷掉的钱。", "shortMeaning": "我无法不去想被偷的钱。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ded9db89-2a5b-4991-8b94-9e3a19c2adb1", "text": "我无法信任像他那样的人。", "shortMeaning": "我信不过像他那样的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ae199dd6-6781-4be2-9cca-0ce7a7c502d5", "text": "我无法再忍受那噪音了。", "shortMeaning": "我再也受不了那噪音了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ec013456-7b77-4c9f-8385-1467d80a2dca", "text": "我无法判断他的话是真是假。", "shortMeaning": "我分不清他的话真假。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ac724a9f-c09a-4fd5-82b5-f3249d2ac7b4", "text": "我无法区分青蛙和蟾蜍。", "shortMeaning": "我分不清青蛙和蟾蜍。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c2bcdb15-aa7e-4c45-8629-1ac0718897ee", "text": "我无法同意你的意见。", "shortMeaning": "我不同意你的意见。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d0c2cbef-a3f3-4227-8213-7872a4a00334", "text": "我无法同意你的观点。", "shortMeaning": "我不同意你的观点。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2bbe60c1-514f-49fc-8f68-4f511f5d2b4e", "text": "我无法同意您的提案。", "shortMeaning": "我不同意您的提案。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:da306eb7-84c3-4f6d-9e97-339363d052a2", "text": "我无法回答所有问题。", "shortMeaning": "我没法回答所有问题。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0f5eac6a-e2c1-4150-a963-2bd6fbd9b1a3", "text": "我无法忍受他的蛮横无礼。", "shortMeaning": "我受不了他的蛮横无礼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:73858d5c-b928-4005-b3a9-aa3c2e78ee1e", "text": "我无法忍受她傲慢的态度。", "shortMeaning": "我受不了她傲慢的态度。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2e6634a2-cf04-4029-ae35-6bd12aa0d29f", "text": "我无法忍受看着动物受苦。", "shortMeaning": "我不忍看动物受苦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:92fa8573-69b3-4bdb-b982-a38e885b6d62", "text": "我无法忍受看着她。", "shortMeaning": "我受不了看着她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5ab1e429-bccd-4a8b-bee3-23c79446eac4", "text": "我无法忍受这像沙袋一样沉甸甸的沉默。", "shortMeaning": "我受不了这沙袋般沉重的沉默。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9a831325-2934-4c9b-a247-244267f40e0e", "text": "我无法忍受这里的寒冷。", "shortMeaning": "我受不了这里的寒冷。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ca3532d8-f010-4fb7-9d76-73c476001fe4", "text": "我无法忘记那天发生了什么。", "shortMeaning": "我无法忘记那天发生的事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:55a89ac3-ceb1-48c7-bcbb-a8c08037d8ff", "text": "我无法想象另一个星球上的生物。", "shortMeaning": "我想象不出外星生物。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:381e194d-f59b-498b-b85c-3ce2b0edbff7", "text": "我无法想象没有他的生活。", "shortMeaning": "我想象不出没有他的生活。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:970e6a75-60fb-45c8-a457-6bf8d9fe5722", "text": "我无法找到问题的根源。", "shortMeaning": "我找不到问题的根源。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5cc1845d-2db7-404f-93c9-89314b1b8691", "text": "我无法独自解决这个问题。", "shortMeaning": "这个问题我独自解决不了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1c476fc4-bc03-4308-b5f1-d0d64e6c50bc", "text": "我无法独自面对这种生活。", "shortMeaning": "这种生活我独自扛不住。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2e894831-857e-46a2-aa4b-022fba5035e9", "text": "我无法理解他的逻辑。", "shortMeaning": "我搞不懂他的逻辑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:720038de-ebe9-45fb-a0db-5c59dbfdcdc6", "text": "我无法相信自己的眼睛。", "shortMeaning": "我简直不敢相信自己的眼睛。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7c09970f-cf11-42c6-978f-6d7ae7833539", "text": "我无法解决这个问题，这对我来说太难了。", "shortMeaning": "这个问题我解决不了，对我来说太难了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:81fc4a4c-3842-49f6-b93d-d5b01d540e0f", "text": "我无法遏制住我的怒火。", "shortMeaning": "我无法遏制我的怒火。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a6d5f519-a4b3-440a-8fe5-0878867e347d", "text": "我无论如何都想不出正确的话。", "shortMeaning": "我无论如何都想不出合适的话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ef8a2be7-0816-489f-8b1e-da10378f9ba6", "text": "我既不会看法语，又不会说。", "shortMeaning": "我既看不懂法语，也不会说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a827010f-569d-4e3f-b4bd-2b7789a979b7", "text": "我既不抽烟也不喝酒。", "shortMeaning": "我烟酒都不沾。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f3bbcccc-7fe4-43a5-a18b-1ee926c4d0b6", "text": "我既不抽烟又不喝酒。", "shortMeaning": "我烟酒都不碰。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f17c9591-d46d-41af-a8e5-871c3bf369c8", "text": "我既不是雅典人也不是希腊人。", "shortMeaning": "我既非雅典人也非希腊人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5da3883b-57ca-4e91-b92a-fb1b313a9553", "text": "我既不知道他的名字也不知道他住哪儿。", "shortMeaning": "我既不知道他的名字也不知道他住哪。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b51980f1-b9bf-483b-a2c9-a15e839c4444", "text": "我既有比较强的英语听力、口语、写作能力，又受到中文语言文字的系统训练。", "shortMeaning": "我英语听说写都不错，又受过中文系统训练。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fca88858-4869-4808-b59d-53e0b74fc506", "text": "我既没时间购物，又没时间跟我妈妈说再见。", "shortMeaning": "我既没时间购物，也没时间跟妈妈说再见。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7c97bf00-437e-41d4-9a51-51abb405f8d1", "text": "我早上8点时，通常已经起床了。", "shortMeaning": "我早上八点通常已起床。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2bbc54ef-aae5-4ec3-b8d2-8484ce918fa8", "text": "我早该事先打电话预约座位了。", "shortMeaning": "我早该先打电话订位了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:52a02b94-adc6-487c-9e28-cf86ea840e44", "text": "我早饭吃了馕再喝了茶。", "shortMeaning": "我早饭吃了馕又喝了茶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0ccf8fe6-8aea-44ca-a77e-99fcdfaaa582", "text": "我时不时得到母亲的消息。", "shortMeaning": "我时不时有母亲的消息。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2250fedc-f1bd-486e-aedc-5a09fcecdfbc", "text": "我时差还没倒过来呢。", "shortMeaning": "我时差还没倒好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b25101b1-c80d-4460-be01-c9f5398ef242", "text": "我时而乐观，时而悲观。", "shortMeaning": "我一会儿乐观，一会儿悲观。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4ef47dcc-ceab-4e6b-9c67-8bf0318df0f3", "text": "我时间有点来不及，只能出门买大饼油条。", "shortMeaning": "我时间来不及，只能出门买大饼油条。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b3e5e51a-8c9f-43b8-b1a4-89b5ccda9d31", "text": "我明年想出国留学。", "shortMeaning": "我明年想出国读书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ca7220e-eaa3-4540-aba8-734a436bfe60", "text": "我明年想学普通话。", "shortMeaning": "我明年想学汉语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0c7276a7-5ec4-4742-bdac-0332ebe3effc", "text": "我明年要去夏威夷。", "shortMeaning": "我明年去夏威夷。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c0c0f98c-352c-485c-ac79-06e711f6e42d", "text": "我明早八点来接你。", "shortMeaning": "我明早八点接你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:374b514c-e71a-4e6d-a2f9-4b82f6892149", "text": "我明明没招惹任何人。", "shortMeaning": "我明明谁都没招惹。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4e5e0374-b0a0-4f01-a59d-ba4abefa007f", "text": "我明明看见一只猫钻进纸箱里了。", "shortMeaning": "我明明看见一只猫钻进纸箱了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7d9924d8-f08a-411d-9abf-8d1a5663dd05", "text": "我明白你们的意思了吗？", "shortMeaning": "我理解你们的意思了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e3a4ffb9-86de-4824-b9ad-892fe93ecb32", "text": "我明白你有多不幸。", "shortMeaning": "我懂你有多不幸。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cc4084f8-89da-4f7b-b5e9-9881bacfed69", "text": "我明白她想说什么了？", "shortMeaning": "我明白她想说什么了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ac0cf6fa-9dbf-4976-85aa-5565a8bda63e", "text": "我明白怎么解决问题。", "shortMeaning": "我知道怎么解决问题。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:13eaba8f-0379-484d-9983-e77c45ceffa6", "text": "我星期二和星期四下午 2:30 回家。", "shortMeaning": "我周二和周四下午两点半回家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:60f9b584-8933-463a-9258-a4a696613472", "text": "我昨天完成了工作。", "shortMeaning": "我昨天做完了工作。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b8ec9484-6bec-4907-8b52-db29f1b4dd1a", "text": "我昨天碰到你父母了。", "shortMeaning": "我昨天遇见你父母了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d82eca4e-74e6-45dd-90cf-710c689c3078", "text": "我昨天遇到了一个许久不见的老朋友。", "shortMeaning": "我昨天遇到一位许久不见的老朋友。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:847a66c6-0f39-4b43-96ff-bdc0d178dad1", "text": "我昨晚做了一个很奇怪的梦。", "shortMeaning": "我昨晚做了个很奇怪的梦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5fe77cdf-1145-4c93-b2f9-205cc16376ef", "text": "我昨晚十二点去睡的。", "shortMeaning": "我昨晚十二点睡的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9cf17154-6db3-4374-ab16-063bbc877c5d", "text": "我昨晚在床上看书的时候点着灯就睡了。", "shortMeaning": "我昨晚在床上点灯看书就睡着了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:88b836a4-a99e-4542-bcc7-2d8b7260e359", "text": "我昨晚在新闻短篇片中看到了英国的女兵队，里面虽有几个看不出是男是女，但大部分还是比较女性化的，而且还看不出有什么滑稽的。", "shortMeaning": "我昨晚在新闻短片看到英国女兵队，多数挺女性化，并不滑稽。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:59c76acd-b0b4-4748-8163-07341a7eb107", "text": "我昨晚在机场打地铺睡了一觉，今天就着凉了。", "shortMeaning": "我昨晚在机场打地铺睡，今天就着凉了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c1201dcb-f495-4318-8b42-bde412589078", "text": "我昨晚差点踩到一只臭鼬。", "shortMeaning": "我昨晚差点踩到臭鼬。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:72c0e4c5-2307-4f86-8eb7-934d5903f3bb", "text": "我昨晚应该早点睡觉的。", "shortMeaning": "我昨晚应该早点睡。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a78a016c-2393-4e5e-8683-6893adde95a9", "text": "我昨晚跟他通电话了。", "shortMeaning": "我昨晚跟他通了电话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6e023b52-34c3-448b-817a-c87c86e56f84", "text": "我是1968年在东京诞生的。", "shortMeaning": "我1968年生于东京。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:29999ff3-8414-4133-ad05-5c1d2068ce0f", "text": "我是一个共产主义者。", "shortMeaning": "我是共产主义者。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0b20daf6-0633-4f3e-8a9a-97beb7fc6b34", "text": "我是一个有名的演员。", "shortMeaning": "我是知名演员。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:43aa07bb-51ab-4fb5-91bf-f77f319b258b", "text": "我是一只猫。我还没有名字。", "shortMeaning": "我是一只猫，还没有名字。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9ca8e2f6-f4bf-4f59-9557-719e051a339a", "text": "我是一只饿了的蜘蛛。", "shortMeaning": "我是一只饥饿的蜘蛛。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:65e52360-b322-4236-8498-f8fd467f547b", "text": "我是一只鸭子。我说英语。", "shortMeaning": "我是一只鸭子，我说英语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:737299ad-e729-489c-a986-ed4bb3445c1b", "text": "我是上个月来的北京。", "shortMeaning": "我是上个月来北京的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:019d25ca-1a17-4902-87e2-26ceaa719411", "text": "我是上海话母语者。", "shortMeaning": "我的母语是上海话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d2479c69-0944-48ff-83a5-e3e60b4492d1", "text": "我是不会向那些人借钱的。", "shortMeaning": "我不会向那些人借钱。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9b951423-1b2b-4165-ad3d-239f4f964e2c", "text": "我是不会系领带的。", "shortMeaning": "我不会系领带。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e97d681d-11df-4324-9a3c-aa0f805ba133", "text": "我是不是五月出生的？", "shortMeaning": "我是五月出生的吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bb139120-0cb7-4ea8-9fdc-c3ede8817963", "text": "我是不是得罪他了？", "shortMeaning": "我得罪他了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9006a5ad-01d3-4e59-813e-fdbebd8a89d0", "text": "我是不是能收回我的钱？", "shortMeaning": "我能收回我的钱吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8ecdb52a-1fa0-42a3-adb4-b6ec604a7ecc", "text": "我是世界上最幸运的人。", "shortMeaning": "我是世上最幸运的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b28a4aa-cd7b-4b0a-9ca5-effda45ddddd", "text": "我是个化妆师，每当我把一个姑娘变成大美女。", "shortMeaning": "我是化妆师，常把姑娘变成大美女。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4062f660-55fa-42f1-854f-89a13d035cdd", "text": "我是个很自私的人，但是遇到你之后变得特别地无私。", "shortMeaning": "我本来很自私，遇到你后变得特别无私。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3d236aa9-fe02-4511-8e10-16323d07d79e", "text": "我是个有决心、有条理、有责任的人。", "shortMeaning": "我是个有决心、有条理、有责任心的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c9a1c356-8ff9-4955-b3bd-b276bfb395ed", "text": "我是个有缺点的人，但这些缺点很容易就能被改正。", "shortMeaning": "我有缺点，但这些缺点很容易改正。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ab1634f8-4441-4cdd-a963-45322a62e816", "text": "我是个脚踏实地的人。", "shortMeaning": "我是个踏实的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9ffab3ac-a3ae-46d6-aa72-2d26867a4a58", "text": "我是个自由的灵魂。", "shortMeaning": "我的灵魂是自由的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7f0ab732-aef4-4099-8577-003145f2827a", "text": "我是个高尔夫大球迷。", "shortMeaning": "我是个高尔夫铁杆球迷。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:465acd1f-c04a-43d5-b5f9-e19cd0b725ae", "text": "我是中国人，我爱中国。", "shortMeaning": "我是中国人，我爱祖国。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:518371a8-b680-4063-a098-40632b697685", "text": "我是从我的自身经验来说的。", "shortMeaning": "我是凭自身经验说的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c34594a9-79a7-43b3-965f-2f97ef6dfd71", "text": "我是从新加坡来的。", "shortMeaning": "我来自新加坡。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d93668dd-61a1-4b67-946d-e73067dc9858", "text": "我是你的，而你是我的。", "shortMeaning": "我是你的，你是我的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9c6e9df0-7d27-484c-8fd3-706e3f0334bf", "text": "我是倒数第二个得知这个坏消息的。", "shortMeaning": "这坏消息我倒数第二个知道。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b6b1cd82-c827-44a4-9bb9-88524118dd28", "text": "我是只饥饿的蜘蛛。", "shortMeaning": "我是只饿蜘蛛。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:387fb062-d867-4148-baab-78e08955a4e2", "text": "我是同性恋，所以呢？", "shortMeaning": "我是同性恋，那又怎样？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:802d3cc1-8025-4729-b604-26e3fcef235c", "text": "我是唯一的幸存者。", "shortMeaning": "我是唯一幸存者。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d9af65b2-cf0b-43de-b6b3-03b65566ac9d", "text": "我是唯一能做到那个的人。", "shortMeaning": "只有我能做到那件事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2ee4637d-4db7-4838-ae5b-10e7d5f8e281", "text": "我是在一九六二年三月二十二日出生的。", "shortMeaning": "我1962年3月22日出生。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4b0f3fc6-4afb-4cea-a839-c97af12a1f1a", "text": "我是在日本上的中学。", "shortMeaning": "我中学是在日本读的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9db5c5f7-a12e-4444-a0f8-8e4fbdd93e31", "text": "我是在浙江出生的。", "shortMeaning": "我出生在浙江。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
